<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - KN Energy Inc a strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - KN Energy Inc a strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Edward Jones said Tuesday it upgraded KN Energy Inc to strong buy from buy, based on long-term fundamental outlook and strategy.</p>
<p>-- Jones said low double-digit earnings growth is expected in all of KN Energy's operating units in 1997.</p>
<p>-- KN Energy is a natural gas services provider.</p>
<p>-- Its shares closed up 7/8 Tuesday at 38-7/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
